a&_nc_ohc=vqTHWRUQSYsQ7kNvwEBBF94&_nc_oc=AdourefevMjrk2eTuYJ_b1ygEwMSxZspbEpDP1uM3ctVN6_6lhobhS6Vb4l2hIWkQqw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7lWCOdwdg51kvM4aNL4JFeUW6Uzy742zrNqBGuMKQpOA&oe=6A106AB4"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1445333200454352", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827567_1445333203787685_3077006138433745479_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RiliA3UX2n4Q7kNvwFxpaBR&_nc_oc=Ado7UsDufNIDNTULxVqGwD7qkXgtJDpWNNsHRqGZycD_21A5V3vFGh1l-nX9MXJkm98&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4m0x-r1I8uXqg0cQWRASKieI_qcw-H1psNTgjahkBpfw&oe=6A106F88"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "4464271813855098", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_4464271817188431_4351634089041173267_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fV3DzZ6L8WEQ7kNvwG7mh1l&_nc_oc=Adrt0tK45GzXmLGo_7e7W9MluKiyG23dJFEw2J9bKjTb3yTS5-fnkKEJ45mWfqRUB7s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7eMg62Zxj1J9NC8OkVHYhJsVMx3wEt9CmZiOGGrg5OCw&oe=6A1077FE"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "755750850943818", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_755750854277151_2031332832313500751_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mUPD4rwWe2IQ7kNvwHM0tjs&_nc_oc=AdqceNJ-uycwonmQ9YHqftWuEGUg5TO42SzDyiuMXJorlF2NUIhoC06XKKDDi6bH_xc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6ULyLzO7XfF8oX_nH3buBVF4kO25-hxJIK8f5j3CkZJA&oe=6A105034"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pet Care - Vet Hospital Simulator VR", "keywords": ["doctorgames", "petgames", "simulator", "hospitalgames", "pethospital"], "long_description": "Welcome to Pet Care \u2013 Vet Hospital Simulator VR, a fun and immersive veterinary simulation game in VR where you become a real pet doctor and run your own animal hospital!\n\nStep inside your fully interactive VR vet clinic and care for adorable pets including dogs, cats, and more. Diagnose illnesses, treat injuries, perform checkups, and use realistic medical tools to help your furry patients feel better.\n\n\ud83d\udc3e Become a Real Vet in VR\n\nExperience hands-on pet treatment using interactive medical equipment. Examine pets, check their symptoms, clean wounds, apply medicine, and complete engaging treatment procedures in a fully immersive virtual environment.\n\n\ud83c\udfe5 Manage Your Own Animal Hospital\n\nTake responsibility for your growing veterinary clinic. Welcome new patients, guide them to treatment areas, and provide the best care to keep tails wagging and paws happy.\n\n\ud83d\udc36 Treat Cute and Adorable Pets\n\nEach animal has unique conditions and reactions. Stay attentive, follow the right steps, and become the most trusted pet doctor in town.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Casual & Relaxing Gameplay\n\nEasy-to-learn mechanics make this a perfect VR simulation experience for players of all ages. Enjoy satisfying tasks, smooth controls, and rewarding pet care moments.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f Immersive Virtual Reality Experience\n\nDesigned specifically for VR, interact naturally with tools, pets, and your clinic environment. Feel like you\u2019re truly inside a real vet hospital.\n\nIf you love pet care games, veterinary simulators, animal doctor games, ", "short_description": "Become a virtual pet doctor in Pet Care \u2013 Vet Hospital Simulator VR! Diagnose, treat, and care for adorable animals in your own interactive VR veterinary clinic."}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-games-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"},